feroxi-underwater-no-water = You need to be standing in water to dive.

alerts-feroxi-underwater-name = Underwater
alerts-feroxi-underwater-desc = You're under the water, hidden save for your fin. You swim faster and strike harder down here.

ent-ActionFeroxiDive = Dive
    .desc = Slip beneath the surface. Only your dorsal fin stays visible, you swim 50% faster, your unarmed strikes hit twice as hard, and your footsteps fall silent.

ent-ActionFeroxiSurface = Surface
    .desc = Rise back out of the water. You surface on your own if you leave the water, or if you are knocked down or badly hurt.
